The LongBench v2 snapshot is derived from zai-org/LongBench-v2 at the exact
revision and SHA-256 recorded in snapshot_metadata.json.

The Hugging Face dataset repository declares the dataset under Apache-2.0:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/zai-org/LongBench-v2

InferGrade selects a bounded local subset and reports it as an InferGrade
LongBench v2-derived reference. It is not an official leaderboard result.
